  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "If using homemade empanadas, bake for 10-12 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "In a pan, heat 1 tsp of sesame oil over medium heat.",
    "Add shredded cabbage and cook until wilted, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Stir in zesty, soy sauce, sugar, and rice vinegar (if using).",
    "Let the mixture cool slightly.",
    "Place a spoonful of the cabbage mixture onto each empanada, leaving a small border around the edges.",
    "Brush the empanadas with sesame oil and bake for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "Serve warm."
